### TrainTicketing 全链路接口脚本（经网关 8000，打真实容器部署）
###
### 使用方法（容器部署，推荐）：
###   1. 前置：docker compose up -d（五个容器全部 Up/healthy）
###   2. 直接点击文件顶部的"Run all requests"一键整跑——
###      容器内 member 开启了 member.sms.mock-return-code=true，
###      send-code 响应会直接带回验证码并由脚本自动接住，无需手动填码
###
### 使用方法（本地 mvn 跑服务，验证码只进日志）：
###   1. 单独运行"1. 发送验证码"，终端执行下面命令取 6 位码：
###        docker compose logs member --tail 20 | grep 生成短信验证码
###   2. 在本文件顶部加一行（替换真实码）：@code = 654321
###   3. 从"2. 登录"开始依次执行
###
### 所有 ID 通过响应处理器自动传递（token/stationAId/orderNo...），
### 车站名/车次编号带时间戳后缀，整文件可重复执行不撞唯一约束
###
### 链路覆盖：发码 → 登录(JWT) → 乘车人 → 车站×3 → 车次 → 经停站×3
###          → 车厢 → 座位档案 → 票价 → 每日排班 → 当日座位+余票缓存
###          → 车次查询 → 区间余票 → 下单 → 订单列表 → 支付 → 详情 → 退票 → 余票回补

@mobile = 13912345678
@runDate = 2026-09-12
@gateway = http://localhost:8000

### 1. 发送验证码（容器模式响应 content 即验证码，本地模式进日志）
POST {{gateway}}/member/member/send-code
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

mobile={{mobile}}

> {%
  client.global.set("sfx", String(Date.now() % 100000));
  client.global.set("trainCode", "T" + (Date.now() % 10000));
  if (response.body.content) {
    client.global.set("code", response.body.content);
  }
%}

### 2. 登录（容器模式验证码已自动接住；本地模式需在文件顶部加 @code = 真实码）
POST {{gateway}}/member/member/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

mobile={{mobile}}&code={{code}}

> {%
  client.assert(response.body.success, "登录失败：验证码错误或已过期（5 分钟有效），重跑第 1 步再试");
  client.global.set("token", response.body.content.token);
  client.global.set("memberId", response.body.content.id);
%}

### 3. 新增乘车人（下单乘车人快照来源）
POST {{gateway}}/member/passenger/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"memberId": {{memberId}}, "name": "测试乘客", "idCard": "110101199001019999", "type": "1"}

> {%
  client.global.set("passengerId", response.body.content);
%}

### 4. 车站：北京西（始发）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/station/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=北京西{{sfx}}&namePinyin=beijingxi&namePy=BJX&city=北京

> {%
  client.global.set("stationAId", response.body.content);
%}

### 5. 车站：石家庄（中间站）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/station/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=石家庄{{sfx}}&namePinyin=shijiazhuang&namePy=SJZ&city=石家庄

> {%
  client.global.set("stationBId", response.body.content);
%}

### 6. 车站：郑州东（终到）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/station/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=郑州东{{sfx}}&namePinyin=zhengzhoudong&namePy=ZZD&city=郑州

> {%
  client.global.set("stationCId", response.body.content);
%}

### 7. 车次（编号格式：字母+1~4位数字，如 G1234）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/train/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

code={{trainCode}}&type=1&startStationId={{stationAId}}&endStationId={{stationCId}}&startTime=08:00&endTime=09:30

> {%
  client.global.set("trainId", response.body.content);
%}

### 8. 经停站：站序1（始发站只有发车时间，不传 arriveTime）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/train-station/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

trainId={{trainId}}&stationId={{stationAId}}&stationIndex=1&leaveTime=08:00

### 9. 经停站：站序2（中间站）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/train-station/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

trainId={{trainId}}&stationId={{stationBId}}&stationIndex=2&arriveTime=08:40&leaveTime=08:42

### 10. 经停站：站序3（终到站只有到达时间，不传 leaveTime）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/train-station/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

trainId={{trainId}}&stationId={{stationCId}}&stationIndex=3&arriveTime=09:30

### 11. 车厢（二等座编码 3，每排 A B C D F，10 座）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/train-carriage/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

trainId={{trainId}}&carriageIndex=1&seatType=3&seatCount=10

> {%
  client.global.set("carriageId", response.body.content);
%}

### 12. 生成座位档案（返回生成数量）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/train-seat/generate?carriageId={{carriageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 票价（当前为车次+座位类型单一价，区间计价在 Roadmap）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/train-price/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

trainId={{trainId}}&seatType=3&price=100.00

### 14. 每日排班
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/daily-train/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

trainId={{trainId}}&runDate={{runDate}}

> {%
  client.global.set("dailyTrainId", response.body.content);
%}

### 15. 生成当日座位 + 初始化 Redis 余票缓存（漏了这步下单必失败）
POST {{gateway}}/business/admin/daily-train-seat/generate?dailyTrainId={{dailyTrainId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. 按起终站查车次（公开接口）
GET {{gateway}}/business/ticket/query?fromStationId={{stationAId}}&toStationId={{stationCId}}&runDate={{runDate}}

### 17. 查区间余票（公开接口；此时应为 10）
GET {{gateway}}/business/ticket/query-remaining?dailyTrainId={{dailyTrainId}}&departStationId={{stationAId}}&arriveStationId={{stationCId}}

### 18. 下单（幂等键每次随机；memberId 由网关注入不信任前端）
POST {{gateway}}/business/order/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotentKey": "{{$uuid}}",
  "dailyTrainId": {{dailyTrainId}},
  "departStationId": {{stationAId}},
  "arriveStationId": {{stationCId}},
  "runDate": "{{runDate}}",
  "seatType": "3",
  "passengers": [
    {"passengerId": {{passengerId}}, "name": "测试乘客", "idCard": "110101199001019999"}
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("orderNo", response.body.content);
%}

### 19. 我的订单列表
GET {{gateway}}/business/order/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. 支付（待支付 → 已支付）
POST {{gateway}}/business/order/pay?orderNo={{orderNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. 订单详情（含座位/车厢/区间明细）
GET {{gateway}}/business/order/detail?orderNo={{orderNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. 退票（已支付订单退票，释放区间占用并回补缓存）
POST {{gateway}}/business/order/refund?orderNo={{orderNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. 再查余票（退票释放后应回到 10）
GET {{gateway}}/business/ticket/query-remaining?dailyTrainId={{dailyTrainId}}&departStationId={{stationAId}}&arriveStationId={{stationCId}}
